"# Tool peek_now_time\n\nGet the current time of day in UTC, as ISO 8601. No arguments. Changes nothing.\n\nUse it whenever you need the date or the time; do not guess. For the daemon clock's cycle use `peek_clock`.\n\n```json\n{}\n```\n-> `2026-11-11T03:24:34Z`\n\nThe `Z` means UTC. If someone wants a local time, convert it yourself (Asia/Taipei = UTC+8).\n\nErrors: `ArgumentsBad` (give `{}`, no keys; `aos/errors.json#/common/input`).\n"
